<!doctype html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Запит на доступ до API</title>
    <style>
        @font-face {
            font-family: 'SF Pro Display';
            src: url('/fonts/SFProDisplay-Medium.woff') format('woff');
            font-weight: 500;
            font-style: normal;
            font-display: swap;
        }
        @font-face {
            font-family: 'SF Pro Display';
            src: url('/fonts/SFProDisplay-Regular.woff') format('woff');
            font-weight: normal;
            font-style: normal;
            font-display: swap;
        }
        @font-face {
            font-family: 'SF Pro Display';
            src: url('/fonts/SFProDisplay-Semibold.woff') format('woff');
            font-weight: 600;
            font-style: normal;
            font-display: swap;
        }
        * {
            -webkit-box-sizing: border-box;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        html, body {
            min-height: 100%;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'SF Pro Display', Verdana, sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #1c1c1e;
            background: #f7f7f7;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .page {
            max-width: 520px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 16px 12px 40px;
        }
        .header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 8px 0 16px;
        }
        i.logo {
            display: block;
            height: 60px;
            width: 170px;
            background: url('/i/kd_logo.svg') center / contain no-repeat;
        }
        .card {
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 20px 16px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 600;
            line-height: 1.25;
            margin: 0 0 12px;
        }
        p.description {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #3c3c43;
            margin: 0;
        }
        label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #8e8e93;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }
        .field {
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        input[type="text"], textarea {
            -webkit-appearance: none;
            width: 100%;
            border: 1px solid #e4e4e4;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 12px;
            font: inherit;
            line-height: 1.4;
            color: inherit;
            background: #fff;
            outline: none;
        }
        textarea {
            min-height: 120px;
            resize: vertical;
        }
        input[type="text"]:focus, textarea:focus {
            border-color: #3d85f7;
        }
        button, a.button {
            -webkit-appearance: none;
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: #3d85f7;
            color: #fff;
            font: inherit;
            font-weight: 500;
            text-align: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 15px 22px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        button.id-gov-ua {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            white-space: nowrap;
            background: #000;
            border-radius: 25px;
            height: 48px;
            padding: 0 22px;
        }
        a.button.secondary {
            background: #ebebeb;
            color: #1c1c1e;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }
        .error-message {
            color: #721c24;
            background: #f8d7da;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
        .token {
            word-break: break-all;
            border: 1px solid #e4e4e4;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 15px;
            user-select: all;
        }
    </style>
    </head>
<body>
<div class="page">
    <div class="header"><i class="logo"></i></div>
        <div class="card">
        <h1>Запит на доступ до API</h1>
        <p class="description">Щоб почати використовувати API тривог застосунку “Київ Цифровий” потрібно зареєструвати клієнта та отримати API-токен.</p>
    </div>
    <form action="https://kyiv.digital/open-api/register" method="POST">
        <div class="card">
            
            <div class="field">
                <label for="name">ПІБ/Назва компанії</label>
                <input id="name" type="text" name="name" autocomplete="off"
                       required minlength="2" maxlength="150" value="">
            </div>
            <div class="field">
                <label for="description">Для чого потрібно API</label>
                <textarea id="description" name="description"
                          required minlength="10" maxlength="1000"></textarea>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" class="id-gov-ua">
                Продовжити з
                <img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," class="object-contain select-none" style="height: 24px;margin-left: 10px;padding-top: 2px;">
            </button>
        </div>
    </form>
</div>
